<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Create Account</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body>

```
<div class="w-full min-h-screen bg-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center">
    
    <div class="bg-zinc-800 p-8 rounded-xl w-[350px]">
        <h3 class="text-3xl mb-6 text-white text-center font-semibold">
            Create Account
        </h3>

        <form action="/register" method="post" class="flex flex-col gap-4">

            <input 
                class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 outline-none bg-transparent border-2 border-zinc-700 text-white placeholder:text-zinc-400"
                type="text" 
                placeholder="Name" 
                name="name"
            >

            <input 
                class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 outline-none bg-transparent border-2 border-zinc-700 text-white placeholder:text-zinc-400"
                type="text" 
                placeholder="Username" 
                name="username"
            >

            <input  
                class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 outline-none bg-transparent border-2 border-zinc-700 text-white placeholder:text-zinc-400"
                type="password" 
                placeholder="Password" 
                name="password"
            >

            <input 
                class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 outline-none bg-transparent border-2 border-zinc-700 text-white placeholder:text-zinc-400"
                type="email" 
                name="email" 
                placeholder="Email"
            >

            <input 
                class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 outline-none bg-transparent border-2 border-zinc-700 text-white placeholder:text-zinc-400"
                type="number" 
                placeholder="Age" 
                name="age"
            >

            <input 
                class="rounded-md py-2 bg-blue-500 text-white font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:bg-blue-600 transition"
                type="submit" 
                value="Create Account"
            >

        </form>
    </div>

</div>
```

</body>
</html>
